{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "SPOFE — Cost-Structure API",
    "description": "## Contractual API — Cost-Structure (COUTFLEX)\n\n### Overview\nThis API exposes the Cost-Structure module for economic project management.\nIt follows the **Golden Module** architecture pattern.\n\n### Contracts\n- **COUT-BUD-01**: Budget can only consume APPROVED projects with marginAt70 > 0\n- **COUT-01**: Variable cost ratio must be ≤ 70%\n- **COUT-DEC-02**: Validation/Rejection is terminal (no re-decision)\n\n### Multi-Tenant\nAll endpoints require the `X-Tenant-Id` header for tenant isolation.\n\n### Versioning\n- API Version: 1.0.0\n- Contract Version: COST_STRUCTURE_CONTRACT v1.0.0\n\nGenerated: 2026-02-01T02:42:37.709Z",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "SPOFE Team",
      "url": "https://spofe.example.com",
      "email": "api@spofe.example.com"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "PROPRIETARY",
      "url": "https://spofe.example.com/license"
    }
  },
